Could you let me know the names of the two files you’d like me to compare? Once I have those, I can run:

```json
{
  "function": "diff",
  "arguments": {
    "file_name1": "<first_file_name>",
    "file_name2": "<second_file_name>"
  }
}
```

This will show the line‑by‑line differences between the two files.
